WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.419
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.419 --> 00:00:05.491
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:05.491 --> 00:00:08.991
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:08.991 --> 00:00:09.344
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.344 --> 00:00:13.390
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:16.997
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:17.004 --> 00:00:26.577
Answer the training-versus-inference question.

00:00:26.577 --> 00:00:35.621
Explain what the new prompt definition changes.

00:00:35.621 --> 00:00:45.349
Explain the effect and limitations of retrieval.

00:00:45.349 --> 00:00:48.104
Submit all three answers to unlock the expected explanations.

00:00:48.104 --> 00:00:54.570
Compare the first explanation and self-award two points.

00:00:54.570 --> 00:01:01.112
Compare the prompt explanation and self-award two points.

00:01:01.112 --> 00:01:04.533
Compare the retrieval explanation and self-award two points.

00:01:04.533 --> 00:01:10.249
Inspect the self-assigned 6/6 total and reviewed count.

00:01:10.249 --> 00:01:17.245
Start another exit-ticket attempt with empty answers.
